From e6e3707ab789fdcd8b11929aa90ad6788310f8b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 19:28:02 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 102/140] Refactor UI components and enhance functionality

- Removed unused parameters and actions from BrowserTopBar and SelectionTopBar.
- Updated FileSystemBrowserScreen to handle watch status actions.
- Refactored FolderListScreen to improve pin/unpin functionality.
- Enhanced MediaLibraryContent and VideoListScreen to manage watch status.
- Updated PlayerActivity and PlayerViewModel to utilize new video zoom and pan properties.
- Improved GestureHandler to handle video transformations more effectively.
- Updated VideoZoomSheet to remove unnecessary property retrieval.
- Fixed composition local usage in AppWallpaper.
